OL,3,GNEWSA'Balsam bashers' uproot almost two
OL,4,Amillion plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have been invited to final
OL,7,F"balsam bashing" events in a bid to
OL,8,Fuproot a target of two million invasive
OL,9,FHimalayan balsam plants by the autumn.
OL,11,FEden Rivers Trust has hosted several
OL,12,Fdays this year to pull out the
OL,13,Fnon-native plant - recognisable by its
OL,14,Fpink bonnet-shaped flowers and thin
OL,15,Fstems - from Cumbria's riverbanks,
OL,16,Fpaths and fields.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
