OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Balsam bashers' uproot almost two
OL,4,Amillion plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginating from the Himalayas, it was
OL,7,Fintroduced to the UK by the Victorians
OL,8,Fas a garden plant but spread into the
OL,9,Fcountryside, where it causes native
OL,10,Fplants to disappear and increases
OL,11,Ferosion risks.
OL,13,FThe trust said the plant was "super
OL,14,Feasy to pull out", but added action was
OL,15,Fneeded before they grow too big.
